 0  allow  shell__exec                     -                             default allow
 1  deny   shell__exec                     no-destructive-shell          destructive shell command
 2  deny   shell__exec                     no-destructive-shell          destructive shell command
 3  allow  fs__write_file                  -                             default allow
 4  deny   fs__write_file                  fs-stay-in-repo               writes are confined to the repository
 5  allow  fs__read_file                   -                             default allow
 6  allow  shopware__products_search       read-only-ok                  matched rule read-only-ok (shopware.*_search|shopware.*_get)
 7  ask    shopware__stock_set             shopware-writes-need-approval  this would change live shop data
 8  allow  shopware__stock_set             -                             default allow
 9  allow  shopware__order_get             read-only-ok                  matched rule read-only-ok (shopware.*_search|shopware.*_get)
